This project redistributes audio from the XDG / freedesktop sound theme
("sound-theme-freedesktop"), converted from Ogg Vorbis (.oga) to PCM WAV
for Windows compatibility. The audio content is NOT covered by the MIT
license of the installer scripts.

Upstream project:
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xdg/xdg-sound-theme
  https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Specifications/sound-theme-spec/

Per-file authorship and licenses are listed in CREDITS (copied from the
upstream package). Typical licenses in that theme include CC-BY 3.0,
CC-BY-SA, and GPLv2+.

If you redistribute the WAV files, keep CREDITS and this NOTICE with them.
